nd `worker` used the wrong queue name (`default` instead of `critical`).\n- `api` mounted the named volume at `/var/lib/composeapp` and set `APP_DATA_DIR` to `/tmp/data` instead of mounting `api-data` at `/data` and using `/data`.\n- `depends_on` lost `service_healthy` conditions.\n- `api` healthcheck called `/status` instead of `/healthz`.\n- `db` and `redis` healthchecks were missing.\n\n## Final validation command\n```sh\nPATH=\"/workspace/in/composeapp:$PATH\" python tools/validate_compose.py\n```\n\nThe command passed with output:\n\n```text\ncompose contract ok\n```\n"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":146,"output":415,"cacheRead":22528,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":96,"totalTokens":23089,"cost":{"input":0.00036500000000000004,"output":0.0062250000000000005,"cacheRead":0.005632,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012222}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788201431279,"responseId":"resp_0f0b9d255f73eef4016a95c9d7a57c87d2ad30215e45ec805c","rawStopReason":"completed"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Mx7Sy3TOOFMzBqAB9GqsDtNw|fc_0f0b9d255f73eef4016a95c9dabab487d29335c40949dac281","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[out/compose_fix_report.md#B987]\nSuccessfully wrote 1007 bytes to /workspace/out/compose_fix_report.md"}],"details":{"resolvedPath":"/workspace/out/compose_fix_report.md"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788201440106},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Verifying additional file creation**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0f0b9d255f73eef4016a95c9e1331c87d2866e1e28a834f086\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Verifying additional file creation**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_aXEeSsPbrUUc5K33BMWkvOxZ|fc_0f0b9d255f73eef4016a95c9e22f4887d2bf8db47912032654","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"update","id":"TODO-42fb8c02","status":"c